; Screen functions, text and chart state, pending flight messages
; Jump table used by CallScreenHandler, shared variables and the 104-byte commander record.
; ============================================================================

; VERIFIED: 16 jump instructions, 3 bytes each.  CallScreenHandler calls ScreenFunctionTable + 3*A
; through a patched CALL, with the stack moved to CockpitBitmap.
; Evidence: dispatcher arithmetic; all 16 entries executed in the runtime traces.
ScreenFunctionTable:
    JP BuyCargoScreen                          ; $A7DA: C3 7B B2  function 0: buy cargo (screen 4)
L_A7DD:
